---
description: Express API conventions for the task manager
globs: server/**/*.js
alwaysApply: false
---
- Express 5 + Mongoose, plain JavaScript (CommonJS). No new npm packages without asking.
- Validate every body/query/params with Zod in src/validation, applied via the validate middleware.
- Every task query MUST include userId: req.user.id. Other users' tasks return 404, never 403.
- Responses use { error, status, message, data }.
- Every new endpoint needs tests in server/tests (node:test + supertest), including a test that another user gets 404.
- Run `npm test` inside server/ after changes.
